msgstr "Grupa tłumaczeń (Polylang)"

#: includes/Admin/Ajax.php
msgid ""
"Trial started — Pro works until %s. The key has also been e-mailed to you."
msgstr ""
"Wersja próbna uruchomiona — Pro działa do %s. Klucz wysłano też na Twój "
