#: catcode-polylang-multilingual-shop-for-woocommerce.php
msgid ""
"Two copies of Polylang Multilingual Shop are active. The copy in \"%1$s\" is"
" used; the copy in \"%2$s\" is paused — deactivate and delete the one you do"
